    "faq": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does Drainova actually do?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Drainova supports your body's natural lymphatic flow and fluid balance. Your lymphatic system has no pump of its own, so it relies on movement and support to keep fluid from sitting still. Drainova's four herbs are traditionally used to support that natural drainage process.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it for fat or for fluid?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Fluid. Drainova is not a weight-loss product and we won't pretend it is. A simple way to think about it: body fat changes over weeks and months, while fluid can shift within a single day — it's why you can feel flat in the morning and puffy by dinner. If your issue is that day-to-day fluctuation, that's what Drainova is designed to support.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "faq3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I take it?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>1 dropper (1 mL) twice daily — in water, tea, or juice, or directly under the tongue. Take it consistently and stay hydrated.</p>",
